{"id":"lib-001","title":"Môj deň","body":"Volám sa Peter a bývam v Bratislave. Dnes je pekný deň. Ráno idem do práce. Na ulici vidím veľa ľudí. Pracujem v novom obchode na námestí. V práci mám dobrý počítač. Po práci idem s kamarátom do kina alebo do múzea. Môj brat býva v malom meste pri Bratislave. Má dom, ženu a päť detí. Často mu pomáham. Dnes mu kúpim novú knihu a dobrú kávu. Večer som doma a čítam slovenskú knihu. A kde bývaš ty?","level":"A2","analysis":{"v":1,"sentences":[{"s":0,"e":36,"en":"My name is Peter and I live in Bratislava.","tokens":[{"s":0,"e":5,"t":"word"},{"s":6,"e":8,"t":"word"},{"s":9,"e":14,"t":"word"},{"s":15,"e":16,"t":"word","l":68,"m":"single"},{"s":17,"e":22,"t":"word","l":64,"tag":"v:Kesa+","m":"single"},{"s":23,"e":24,"t":"word","l":50,"m":"single"},{"s":25,"e":35,"t":"word","l":31,"tag":"s6","m":"rule","trig":{"i":5,"kind":"preposition","id":"prep-v-loc"}},{"s":35,"e":36,"t":"punct"}]},{"s":37,"e":55,"en":"Today is a nice day.","tokens":[{"s":37,"e":41,"t":"word","l":71,"m":"single"},{"s":42,"e":44,"t":"word","l":60,"tag":"v:Kesc+","m":"single"},{"s":45,"e":50,"t":"word","l":32,"tag":"s1i","m":"rule"},{"s":51,"e":54,"t":"word","l":30,"tag":"s1","m":"rule"},{"s":54,"e":55,"t":"punct"}]},{"s":56,"e":75,"en":"In the morning I go to work.","tokens":[{"s":56,"e":60,"t":"word"},{"s":61,"e":65,"t":"word","l":62,"tag":"v:Kesa+","m":"single"},{"s":66,"e":68,"t":"word","l":45,"m":"single"},{"s":69,"e":74,"t":"word","l":15,"tag":"s2","m":"rule","trig":{"i":2,"kind":"preposition","id":"prep-do"}},{"s":74,"e":75,"t":"punct"}]},{"s":76,"e":101,"en":"I see a lot of people in the street.","tokens":[{"s":76,"e":78,"t":"word","l":51,"m":"single"},{"s":79,"e":84,"t":"word","l":14,"tag":"s6","m":"rule","trig":{"i":0,"kind":"preposition","id":"prep-na-loc"}},{"s":85,"e":90,"t":"word","l":63,"tag":"v:Kesa+","m":"single"},{"s":91,"e":95,"t":"word"},{"s":96,"e":100,"t":"word","l":28,"tag":"p2","m":"rule"},{"s":100,"e":101,"t":"punct"}]},{"s":102,"e":138,"en